#: main/templates/main/includes/about-main.html:13
msgid "About Wood Life"
msgstr ""

#: main/templates/main/includes/about-main.html:14
msgid ""
"Wood Life is a collection of handcrafted log guest cottages located on the "
"grounds of a private estate near the forest in the heart of the Carpathian "
"Mountains. Here, cozy wooden homes blend perfectly with fresh mountain air, "
"peaceful surroundings, and the authentic atmosphere of nature."
msgstr ""

#: main/templates/main/includes/about-main.html:15
msgid ""
"For over 5 years, we have been welcoming guests who value comfort, privacy, "
"and a quiet escape from city life. Our natural wood cottages create a warm "
"and eco-friendly environment designed for complete relaxation in every "
"season."
msgstr ""

#: main/templates/main/includes/about-main.html:16
msgid ""
"The property offers everything you need for a perfect stay: a wood-fired "
"sauna, cozy gazebos, barbecue areas, and peaceful spaces surrounded by "
"greenery. Mornings begin with birdsong, and evenings are filled with "
"calmness and harmony with nature."
msgstr ""

